{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/ceaa7b211724680ed841b2f5947282cf.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=656 height=605 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/ceaa7b211724680ed841b2f5947282cf.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lara is a young girl from Manaus who is taking a tour around the city with an old friend she had not seen in years. But what was meant to be a simple sightseeing activity unfolds into a dark spiral of mysteries and revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of their tours, Lara realizes that her friend has disappeared. Amid the confusion, she finds in her bag an enigmatic letter, accompanied by the photograph of an abandoned building and an urgent call from her friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome by fear but guided by affection and the desire to find her, Lara decides to follow the trail to the building. As she explores its corridors, she discovers that the place is inhabited by grotesque entities\u2014manifestations of Amazonian myths and urban legends that have taken terrifying physical form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.webm?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step, Lara draws closer not only to the fate of her friend but also to her own deepest fears. The city, its shadows, and its forgotten stories become the stage for a journey where courage and fragility walk side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=968 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.webm?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Do Not Disturb: Untold Tales, progression unfolds through a cycle of tension, discovery, and choice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape and Survival: Learn patterns to evade or outwit enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Puzzles: Solve challenges to unlock new areas and uncover narrative\u00a0secrets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076180?t=1768404827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/188c960bcb1dfac2254b632ed3235a9eddaaa6bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768404827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/6ba438d3c054875276509e96690e03a76ad2b3f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768404827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/6ba438d3c054875276509e96690e03a76ad2b3f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768404827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4125720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/ceaa7b211724680ed841b2f5947282cf.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=656 height=605 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/ceaa7b211724680ed841b2f5947282cf.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lara is a young girl from Manaus who is taking a tour around the city with an old friend she had not seen in years. But what was meant to be a simple sightseeing activity unfolds into a dark spiral of mysteries and revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of their tours, Lara realizes that her friend has disappeared. Amid the confusion, she finds in her bag an enigmatic letter, accompanied by the photograph of an abandoned building and an urgent call from her friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome by fear but guided by affection and the desire to find her, Lara decides to follow the trail to the building. As she explores its corridors, she discovers that the place is inhabited by grotesque entities\u2014manifestations of Amazonian myths and urban legends that have taken terrifying physical form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.webm?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/c9ec3b7778924b5989fb30a61e76b384.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step, Lara draws closer not only to the fate of her friend but also to her own deepest fears. The city, its shadows, and its forgotten stories become the stage for a journey where courage and fragility walk side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.poster.avif?t=1768404827\" width=968 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.webm?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/extras/371f888bfe70045a7bd356750a47d100.mp4?t=1768404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Do Not Disturb: Untold Tales, progression unfolds through a cycle of tension, discovery, and choice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape and Survival: Learn patterns to evade or outwit enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Puzzles: Solve challenges to unlock new areas and uncover narrative\u00a0secrets.</p>","developers":["Hollow Harpy"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076180/31e50e1aba90b426afc7497db471434f22e3b03e/header.jpg?t=1768404827","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076180/1219464188/f9471440d98f5de19f837322166c4b847f236b1d/1762283269/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768404827","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076180/1219464188/f9471440d98f5de19f837322166c4b847f236b1d/1762283269/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768404827","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076180/1219464188/f9471440d98f5de19f837322166c4b847f236b1d/1762283269/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768404827","id":257226847,"name":"Trailer - BR","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226847/899f3ee4f792c95efa0db42c37acc466517f554b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768404827"}],"name":"Do Not Disturb: Untold Tales","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Non compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hollow Harpy"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0